d works fine.\n\n\nAdditionally if you start from Fullscreen; move the window to another screen, then go to Exclusive Fullscreen, sometimes this would cause the window to become windowed instead. This was using the windows hotkeys; but if you set up your own hotkeys and use DisplayServer to set the current screen I could not reproduce it.\n\nI was not able to reproduce the 4.8.beta1 freezing bug in 4.6 or 4.7.2. In those versions though I also could not escape putting the editor in fullscreen mode.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6298387962/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6298568285","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124261#issuecomment-6298568285","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124261","id":6298568285,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABd2yGXQ","user":{"login":"notroid5","id":87585310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NTg1MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87585310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5","html_url":"https://github.com/notroid5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/received_events","type":"User","use